{"title":"Regex String Matching","difficulty":"Hard","statement":"You are given a text `s` and a pattern `p`. Decide whether `p` matches the **entire** string `s` (not just a part of it).\n\nThe pattern is built from these pieces:\n\n- a lowercase letter, which matches exactly that letter;\n- `.`, which matches any single lowercase letter;\n- `x*`, where `x` is a letter or `.`: matches **zero or more** characters, each of which `x` matches;\n- `x+`, where `x` is a letter or `.`: matches **one or more** characters, each of which `x` matches.\n\nWhen `x` is `.`, every repeated character is chosen independently, so `.*` matches any string and `.+` any non-empty string. A `*` or `+` always applies only to the single letter or `.` right before it. The pattern never starts with `*` or `+`, and `*` and `+` never follow another `*` or `+`.","inputFormat":"The first line contains the string `s`.\nThe second line contains the pattern `p`.","outputFormat":"Print `true` if `p` matches the whole of `s`, otherwise print `false`.","constraints":["1 ≤ |s| ≤ 1000","1 ≤ |p| ≤ 1000","s consists of lowercase letters","p consists of lowercase letters, `.`, `*` and `+`, arranged as described above"],"examples":[{"input":"aaab\na*b","output":"true","explanation":"`a*` matches the three a's and `b` matches the last letter."},{"input":"ac\nab+c","output":"false","explanation":"`b+` needs at least one `b`, but the text has none between `a` and `c`."},{"input":"abcab\n.+b","output":"true","explanation":"`.+` matches `abca` (one or more characters of any kind) and `b` matches the final letter."}],"tests":[{"input":"a\na","output":"true"},{"input":"a\nb","output":"false"},{"input":"a\n.","output":"true"},{"input":"a\na+","output":"true"},{"input":"a\nb*a","output":"true"},{"input":"ab\na","output":"false"},{"input":"aa\na","output":"false"},{"input":"a\na*a+","output":"true"},{"input":"abc\n.*","output":"true"},{"input":"abc\n.+c","output":"true"},{"input":"ab\na+b+c*","output":"true"},{"input":"a\nb*","output":"false"},{"input":"aab\nc*a*b","output":"true"},{"input":"abab\n.*b","output":"true"},{"input":"abab\n.+a","output":"false"},{"input":"b\na*b*","output":"true"},{"input":"bababaaa\nab","output":"false"},{"input":"aaaa\n.*","output":"true"},{"input":"bbababaa\nb*ab+a+ba+","output":"true"},{"input":"aabbaab\n.b+b+b+ba","output":"false"},{"input":"a\n.ba.b+.","output":"false"},{"input":"abbbb\na+b*b+","output":"true"},{"input":"aabbbaab\na*b+a+b+.*","output":"true"},{"input":"baaaaaa\nb+aaaaaa","output":"true"},{"input":"baabaa\nbb+.*a.+b","output":"false"},{"input":"bb\nb+","output":"true"},{"input":"bba\n.","output":"false"},{"input":"a\naa*","output":"true"},{"input":"\na*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*a*","output":"true"},{"input":"\","output":"true"},{"input":"\n..................................................................................................................................................................................................................................................